# Where the site lives. One canonical place, read by `state.sh` and `repair.sh`.
#
# It is not derivable from the repository and it is not obvious in the console either:
# the account holds twelve buckets and this is the one the distribution SST built reads
# from. `scripts/cloudfront/dump.sh` is what found it, in the key-value store the old
# routing function consulted.
SITE_BUCKET_DOMAIN=portfolio-op-production-portfoliooptimizerassetsbucket-okwwseht.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com
